{"id":"2014122475764601075","kind":"answer","title":"想要做到看懂日语生肉漫画和小说该怎么做？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-03-08","updated":"2026-03-08","votes":50,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":671,"keywords":["日语学习","沉浸式学习","二语习得","Anki","可理解输入"],"summary":"首先，漫画和小说完全不是一个难度，小说的词汇量要比漫画高很不少，因为漫画以对话为主，而对话用到的词汇都是比较日常向的高频词。而且有画面辅助，不至于搞不懂一句话到底是谁说的（别笑，看日语轻小说哪怕是翻译，我都经常需要看两遍对话才知道哪句话是谁说的） 小说由于会有很多描写，用到的词汇量就比漫画高一大截了。以百合圣经《安达与岛村》为…","question_detail_html":"<p>没学过日语，零基础，汉化组太慢了，想要自力更生 ，只要能看懂就满足啦</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/372496848/answer/2014122475764601075","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"31igfOEQ\">首先，漫画和小说完全不是一个难度，小说的词汇量要比漫画高很不少，因为漫画以对话为主，而对话用到的词汇都是比较日常向的高频词。而且有画面辅助，不至于搞不懂一句话到底是谁说的（别笑，看日语轻小说哪怕是翻译，我都经常需要看两遍对话才知道哪句话是谁说的）</p><p data-pid=\"TKZKzIFC\">小说由于会有很多描写，用到的词汇量就比漫画高一大截了。以百合圣经《安达与岛村》为例。</p><p data-pid=\"dvGMOten\">这是漫画的统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-dddf4f666cea5bae847c0128823d5dc7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dddf4f666cea5bae847c0128823d5dc7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2294\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-dddf4f666cea5bae847c0128823d5dc7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dddf4f666cea5bae847c0128823d5dc7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2294\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rAPk7VJW\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://jiten.moe/decks/media/123506/detail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Adachi to Shimamura - Detail - Jiten</a></p><p data-pid=\"ThSfx__C\">这是小说：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ae905720a7b4b2e35cfd6139595fa1c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ae905720a7b4b2e35cfd6139595fa1c3_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2294\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ae905720a7b4b2e35cfd6139595fa1c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ae905720a7b4b2e35cfd6139595fa1c3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2294\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xK7wr9py\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://jiten.moe/decks/media/106209/detail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Adachi to Shimamura - Detail - Jiten</a></p><p data-pid=\"7Cl0b6WK\">小说的词汇量是 16,337，而漫画只有 5,485，差不多是 3 倍的差距。</p><p data-pid=\"svwdiL0a\">如果想要看懂《安达与岛村》漫画的生肉，只要掌握了这五千多个词汇，再加上 N2 左右的语法，差不多就够了。</p><p data-pid=\"XvIBW1WP\">相比漫画，小说的唯一优势大概就是比较方便查字典。装个 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://yomitan.wiki/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yomitan</a> 浏览器插件后，查词是相当方便的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-e5862e5c89faf276addd5979fcde9303\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5862e5c89faf276addd5979fcde9303_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-e5862e5c89faf276addd5979fcde9303\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-e5862e5c89faf276addd5979fcde9303_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xqxWXlui\">不过现在也有很多工具可以直接在漫画上加文字层，然后用同样的工具就能查词了：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 读终将的漫画 (2026-02-19)\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vCZeBPEjr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">[学日语] 读终将的漫画 (2026-02-19)</a><p data-pid=\"_gNMs2yZ\">我目前学日语也快半年了，每天大概花两小时，现在看日语轻小说的速度只有可怜的 5000 字/小时，离 14000 字/小时还有不少的差距。不过看动画生肉已经可以不带字幕看懂 90% 了。我还是建议题主先从带日语字幕的动画开始，然后过渡到无字幕，这个期间可以开始看点漫画，或者视觉小说和 Galgame，最后上手小说。</p><p data-pid=\"ss5iUppc\">更多日语学习相关的建议，请见 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$4c592f496dc33822b560b382907ff1d0\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/L.M.Sherlock\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组翻译的指南：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a9c1091e34bf1523a9d3efad920beea1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习指南\" data-tm-id=\"2002818500717207719\" href=\"#/post/2002818500717207719\">日语学习指南</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"2002818500717207719","title":"日语学习指南","author":"Shoui","votes":427,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"2003200028689338460","title":"30 天入门日语","author":"UsagiSpoon","votes":254,"minutes":35,"reason":"延伸深读 · UsagiSpoon"},{"id":"2003548240998597680","title":"学日语之 Shoui 方法","author":"Shoui","votes":92,"minutes":67,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005215549949514985","title":"单语指南","author":"Shoui","votes":70,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2004873847392974568","title":"阅读技巧与策略","author":"Shoui","votes":102,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"},{"id":"2005581871279519232","title":"日语学习常见问题解答（FAQ）","author":"Shoui","votes":169,"minutes":23,"reason":"延伸深读 · Shoui"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2007436816991671196","title":"为什么除了中日之外，就没有国家有人喜欢二次元了呢?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1901,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 1901 赞同"},{"id":"2102462801965065232","title":"为什么好多人学日语坚持不下去？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":123,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 123 赞同"},{"id":"2086519476707767126","title":"凭兴趣学好日语容易吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":128,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 128 赞同"},{"id":"2053439845024920936","title":"对于日语学习者，如何选择和开始阅读第一本日文原版书？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":102,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 102 赞同"},{"id":"2085442988537398276","title":"我要日语到达N几才能大致看懂一篇日语小说？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":142,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 142 赞同"}]}